WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,720
Forget it, what I lost was not what I deserved.

2
00:00:06,620 --> 00:00:08,900
This waste recycling work permit is indeed a treasure

3
00:00:08,900 --> 00:00:11,420
I think it will be easy to sell two cars and equipment and become famous.

4
00:00:11,420 --> 00:00:13,620
I really hope there will be more synonyms for sending money in the future

5
00:00:18,410 --> 00:00:19,810
There is another traffic light stop

6
00:00:19,810 --> 00:00:21,330
Try any site tab

7
00:00:22,420 --> 00:00:24,020
Forget it, go to Kabisi

8
00:00:24,020 --> 00:00:25,500
Just save it for when you need it

9
00:00:30,640 --> 00:00:32,880
Dumpster. Isn't this a coincidence?

10
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:43,700
I thought it was those stupid and desperate humans coming here

11
00:00:43,700 --> 00:00:45,260
You made me wait for a long time in vain

12
00:00:45,260 --> 00:00:47,900
You have a work permit. You don’t have to pay. Come in.
